<title>USA: SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT MEXICO 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT MEXICO 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat Mexico 4-0 (halftime 3-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers - Leonardo (5), Romario (12, penalty, 17, 75)</p>
<p>Attendance: 51,500</p>
